# Frontend environment variables (Create React App)
# Notes API configuration:
# - Leave REACT_APP_API_BASE UNSET to use same-origin relative paths (e.g. "/notes"),
#   which is recommended for KAVIA previews/reverse-proxy environments.
# - Set REACT_APP_API_BASE to an absolute URL starting with http:// or https:// to override
#   (e.g. https://api.example.com). Any non-http(s) value will be ignored.
#
# REACT_APP_API_BASE=
